VALUES ('force-placed-insurance-authorization', 'Force-Placed Insurance Authorization', 'other', 'high', 'Lender reserves the right to purchase insurance on the borrower''s behalf if the borrower fails to maintain required coverage, often at significantly higher premiums and with less coverage than a self-purchased policy.', 'Lenders may use this to generate profit through commissions or higher premiums, while providing minimal protection to the borrower''s equity. It can lead to a ''death spiral'' of debt if the borrower cannot afford the new, higher payments.', 'If you forget to pay your insurance, the bank can buy a super-expensive version for you and add it to your bill. This bank-bought insurance usually only protects them, not your belongings.', 'Lender should provide at least 45 days notice and multiple warnings before placing insurance, and must cancel it immediately upon proof of borrower''s own coverage with a full pro-rated refund.', 'We''d like to extend the notice period for force-placed insurance to 60 days and ensure that any policy placed is at market rates without commissions to the lender.', 'Lender shall provide Client with written notice at least forty-five (45) days prior to placing any insurance. Lender shall cancel any force-placed insurance within fifteen (15) days of receiving proof of Client''s own coverage and provide a full pro-rated refund for the overlapping period.', '[-0.015739778,-0.025168268,0.0085026575,-0.0020703813,-0.07173099,0.060563833,0.010809661,0.01921053,0.010911005,0.02415765,0.019753862,-0.011032533,0.06171104,0.0026641402,0.010524637,-0.011074537,-0.011298627,-0.009870162,-0.04458849,-0.057595707,-0.04617478,-0.013632678,-0.06165924,-0.021396486,-0.011271402,-0.07671729,-0.018036451,-0.041259196,-0.022122746,-0.11903186,-0.03694924,0.031127801,0.024073789,-0.053175747,-0.0039978144,-0.053830568,-0.005065788,-0.029206095,0.02357195,-0.04126848,-0.018252315,-0.016547704,-0.0747937,0.0061512063,-0.044509917,-0.03563117,0.0