VALUES ('inflexible-24-hour-claim-reporting-window', 'Inflexible 24-Hour Claim Reporting Window', 'other', 'medium', 'Policy requires insured to report any incident or loss within a very short timeframe (e.g., 24-48 hours), failing which the insurer may deny the claim entirely regardless of the reason for delay.', 'In high-stress situations (accidents, medical emergencies), reporting immediately is often impossible. This clause gives insurers a technicality to deny valid claims.', 'If you don''t call them within 24 hours of an accident, they can refuse to pay—even if you were in the hospital or couldn''t reach a phone.', 'The reporting window should be ''as soon as reasonably practicable'' and denial should only be allowed if the delay actually prejudiced the insurer''s investigation.', 'We''d like to change the reporting requirement to ''as soon as reasonably practicable'' and ensure that claims aren''t denied for late reporting unless it harms your ability to investigate.', 'Insured shall provide notice of any loss as soon as reasonably practicable. Failure to provide notice within a specific timeframe shall not justify denial of a claim unless the Insurer demonstrates that its interests were materially prejudiced by the delay.', '[0.06779101,-0.063030116,0.0071625067,0.011711571,-0.049190752,0.039713673,0.05220711,-0.029635206,0.004781212,0.010609976,-0.005505378,0.036205273,0.061703414,0.015788045,0.022350637,-0.009988105,-0.00084922614,0.005410906,-0.043739393,-0.05783984,-0.0261386,-0.009845592,-0.049316045,-0.021121085,0.0007477942,-0.033368923,0.020342438,0.015618542,0.014345975,-0.08184866,-0.028983293,0.03766853,-0.021733038,0.0097189825,0.0064514154,-0.019257639,0.018586637,0.014056143,0.02155999,-0.03949781,-0.032782596,0.045700934,-0.04667747,-0.01027784,-0.008904944,0.01676326,-0.051973447,-0.0043421723,0.02591503,0.10781473,-0.0060687386,0.03593609,-0.069667794,0.009855322,0.0013166899,-0.020329086,-0.044275478,-0.053842746,-0.00037406242,0.0034794898