VALUES ('rule-of-78s-prepayment-penalty', 'Rule of 78s Prepayment Penalty', 'payment', 'high', 'Uses a mathematical formula (Rule of 78s) to front-load interest payments, ensuring that if the loan is paid off early, the borrower receives a much smaller interest refund than with standard simple interest.', 'Effectively penalizes borrowers for being responsible and paying off debt early. It''s a hidden cost that can add hundreds or thousands to the payoff amount.', 'If you try to pay your loan off early to save on interest, they use a trick formula to make sure they''ve already taken most of the interest anyway.', 'Interest should be calculated using the simple interest method on the declining principal balance.', 'We require the loan to use simple interest rather than the Rule of 78s to ensure that early payoff results in fair interest savings.', 'Interest on this Loan shall be calculated using the simple interest method based on the actual daily unpaid principal balance. No ''Rule of 78s'' or other front-loaded interest formulas shall be applied.', '[0.0018306709,-0.033987477,0.0054386095,0.028574962,-0.031047255,0.00931299,-0.025608748,-0.0040863245,0.015207555,-0.013948703,-0.006630317,0.038079124,0.011187241,-0.025048565,-0.024668565,-0.041947152,0.0066505037,-0.03432381,-0.054489285,-0.020347208,-0.046480164,-0.01371636,0.00014372772,-0.03176947,0.019140616,0.024492577,0.043347046,-0.029113071,-0.0012185323,-0.05967096,0.028141271,0.05206765,-0.0006901311,-0.07610281,-0.0104706315,0.05570682,0.013322519,-0.013425647,0.03411805,0.019311624,-0.044902347,0.116368994,-0.018032672,0.0065271095,-0.022538057,-0.03464417,0.0009954985,-0.018325454,-0.0009584744,0.07764298,0.053835385,0.010021451,-0.020668443,0.013689511,-0.00024357552,-0.06840883,0.037288733,-0.03105849,0.05499478,-0.0024313317,0.035447832,-0.028960643,0.015147628,0.01647549,0.0107514765,0.0073347297,-0.072345726,-0.08575858,-0.06033958,0.0316046,0.019107444,-0.025250034,0.050098922,0.028671414,-0.041671