VALUES ('cross-collateralization-clause', 'Cross-Collateralization Clause', 'other', 'medium', 'Assets used to secure one loan (e.g., a car) are automatically used as collateral for all other current and future loans with the same lender.', 'If you pay off your car loan but fall behind on a credit card from the same bank, they can still repossess your car. It makes it very difficult to fully own any one asset.', 'Even if you pay off your car loan, the bank can still take your car if you miss a payment on a completely different loan or credit card you have with them.', 'Collateral should be tied specifically to the loan it was intended to secure.', 'We''d like to remove the cross-collateralization provision so that each loan is secured only by its own designated collateral.', 'The collateral provided for this Loan shall secure only the obligations arising under this specific Agreement and shall not be used as security for any other past, present, or future indebtedness to the Lender.', '[-0.052799188,0.05159643,0.02568342,0.034827605,-0.014119397,-0.00045899831,-0.0021142394,-0.034550026,-0.03853399,0.014294836,0.029066877,-0.005885438,-0.0008440236,-0.0043961313,0.04860101,-0.04286393,-0.033296455,0.02583827,-0.009651589,-0.014750498,-0.029747726,-0.004628743,-0.021150678,-0.012610691,-0.035019223,-0.042614397,-0.0080361795,-0.03500928,-0.00051779585,-0.086296976,0.022877643,0.01687176,-0.0051478604,-0.07768824,-0.05969812,-0.03284235,-0.04494948,-0.023490924,0.007505091,-0.025062414,-0.048870936,-0.01506636,-0.06568103,-0.012850739,-0.034160536,-0.059133712,-0.01695708,0.024399,-0.0026091936,0.047944136,0.017262999,0.059707403,-0.071261786,0.0012952685,0.02964417,-0.08143156,-0.03259113,-0.073932625,-0.0037874177,0.020492582,0.029357962,0.047877643,-0.011528899,0.020853674,0.029682668,0.022861492,-0.05140257,-0.07709913,-0.11320056,0.056696586,-0.017317187,-0.0063496158,-0.015996126,0.051631954,-0.009563846,-0.083313905,0.01994103,0.0024889838,0.017955892,0.0118361